claim.claim-text:
47. A desalination system comprising:
a) an array of vertically disposed PVs, each PV accommodating one or more desalination membranes;
b) a pipeline grid adapted for conducting fluid to be desalinated to said PVs and produced permeate from said PVs;
c) a plurality of sensors disposed along the longitudinal axis of each PV, adapted to measure flow rate and/or quality of fluid passing through said one or more membranes; and
d) a reader connected to an MFC adapted to be displaced along said PV, to be aligned with at least one of said plurality of sensors, to receive data therefrom,
wherein said system is optionally completely automated and controlled by the MFC; and wherein each PV and each membrane therein optionally have their own index number recognizable by the MFC.
